nt buying, O2=Interest rate buying) (H2-F2 is the number of days between buying the property and refinancing the property which you can caount 105 days)"],["Loan to Value (LTV) Refinance RF","Yellow","Percentage","The loan to new value retio"],["Loan amount Refinance ","White","USD $","we count that by multiplying the ( ARV * Loan to Value Percentage)"],["Interest rate refinancing","Yellow","Percentage","The interest rate for the new loan after refinancing"],["closing cost refinance","White","USD $","we count that by multiplying the Loan amount refinance by 0.015"],["monthly payment refinance","White","USD $","\"=pmt(T2/12,30*12,S2)\" we use this equation to calculate the monthly payment (T2 is Interest rate refinancing, S2 is loan amount refinance)"],["Total Monthly payment after refinancing","White","USD $","\"=V2-(I2/12)-(J2/12)\" (V2 is monthly payment refinance which will be a negative number, I2 is property taxes, J2 is property insurance"],["Cash Flow","White","USD $","Market rent + total monthly payment (note the total monthly payment is a negative number"],["Reservs for maintainance","White","USD $","ARV *0.01"],["Reservs for vacancy","White","USD $","ARV *0.01"],["Total cost","White","USD $","we add all the costs together ( down payment, rehab, holding, closing costs buying, closing costs refinancing, resers for maintinance, reservs for vacancy)"],["Money left in the deal","White","USD $","Total cost + loan amount buying - loan amount refinancing"],["Instant equity gain","White","USD $","ARV - loan amount refinance - money left in the deal"],["Appriciation rate","Yellow","Percentage","Appriciation rate"],["Value in 10 years","White","USD $","\"=C2*(1+AD2)^10\" (C2 is ARV, AD2 is appriciation rate)"],["Loan balance in 10 years","White","USD $","\"=S2+CUMPRINC(T2/12,30*12,S2,1,10*12,0)\" ( S2 is the loan amount refinance, T2 is the interest rate refinance)"],["Equity Gain in 10 years","White","USD $","\"=AE2-AF2-AC2\" (AE is the value in 10 years, AF is loan balance in 10 years, AC money left in the deal)"],["Annual return of investments","White","Percentage","\"=AG2/AC2/10\" (AG is Equity Gain in 10 years, AC is money left in the deal\""],["50% of the annual return","White","Percentage","\"=AH2/2\" (AH is the annual return of investments)"],["","","",""],["Mo Commission","White","USD $","\"0.03 * Purchase price\""],["Mo Managing the rehab","White","USD $","\"0.2 * Rehab cost\""],["Mo managing the tenant ","White","USD $","\"0.1*monthly rent\""]],"headers":{},"rows":[]},{"name":"Buying with SF","headers":{"A":"Address","B":"Purchase price","C":"ARV","D":"Rehab cost","E":"Market Rent","F":"Date buying","G":"Renting date","H":"interest rate buying","I":"Monthly payment PI","J":"TI & MI Escrow","K":"Monthly payment buying PITI","L":"HOA","M":"Closing cost buying","N":"holding cost","O":"Down payment ","P":"Loan Balance","Q":" Reservs for Manitinance","R":"Reservs for Vacancy","S":"Total cost","T":"Instant Equity Gain","U":"Money left in the deal","V":"Appreciation rate","W":"Value in 10 years","X":"Loan balance in 10 years","Y":"Equity gain in 10 years","Z":"Annual return of investments","AA":0.5},"rows":[{"row":2,"cells":{"A":{"v":"5641 W Hunter Hollow Dr, WVC UT ","f":null},"B":{"v":485000,"f":null},"C":{"v":550000,"f":null},"D":{"v":30000,"f":null},"E":{"v":2750,"f":null},"F":{"v":45723,"f":null},"G":{"v":45792,"f":null},"H":{"v":"","f":null},"I":{"v":"","f":null},"J":{"v":"","f":null},"K":{"v":"","f":null},"L":{"v":"","f":null},"M":{"v":"","f":null},"N":{"v":"","f":null},"O":{"v":"","f":null},"P":{"v":"","f":null},"Q":{"v":"","f":null},"R":{"v":"","f":null},"S":{"v":"","f":null},"T":{"v":"","f":null},"U":{"v":"","f":null},"V":{"v":"","f":null},"W":{"v":"","f":null},"X":{"v":"","f":null},"Y":{"v":"","f":null},"Z":{"v":"","f":null},"AA":{"v":"","f":null}}}]}]
